WEBVTT

00:16.520 --> 00:21.710
Master, will you keep 
teaching—no, I mean...

00:21.710 --> 00:26.420
Master, I humbly request that you 
continue teaching me to use a sword.

00:27.200 --> 00:28.480
Of course.

00:29.970 --> 00:32.730
Now that this guy's here, we'll be okay.

00:32.730 --> 00:36.010
After all, I owe Shion-san my life, 
and he taught me to use a sword.

00:36.010 --> 00:36.850
Ow!

00:36.850 --> 00:39.820
Not even these circumstances can stop 
you from acting like my teacher.

00:39.820 --> 00:42.100
I'm actually kind of relieved.

00:43.460 --> 00:45.610
You underestimate me.

00:54.490 --> 00:56.300
I told you, I'm used to that.

01:00.500 --> 01:02.210
Tenza!

01:28.940 --> 01:31.030
The one who takes cannot understand.

01:32.740 --> 01:36.100
But their victim never forgets.

01:51.170 --> 01:52.090
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

01:52.130 --> 01:57.490
<i>A faint flower was blooming 
unnoticed by anyone</i>

01:57.490 --> 02:02.490
<i>Not a burning red, 
but flickering serenely in red</i>

02:02.490 --> 02:07.840
<i>I've been pausing for a long time 
dragging my past at my feet</i>

02:07.840 --> 02:10.440
<i>If I break free from this ambivalence,</i>

02:10.440 --> 02:13.850
<i>will I be able to bloom by its side?</i>

02:13.850 --> 02:16.490
<i>The future is slipping away 
between my fingers</i>

02:16.490 --> 02:19.010
<i>What mistake did I make 
to pay this price?</i>

02:19.010 --> 02:23.860
<i>Always hurting myself</i>

02:23.860 --> 02:29.210
<i>and hesitant even to a small joy</i>

02:29.720 --> 02:31.410
<i>I want to stop now</i>

02:31.410 --> 02:33.930
<i>The flower just bloomed in dignity</i>

02:33.930 --> 02:36.550
<i>and that was all I needed to be happy</i>

02:36.550 --> 02:41.320
<i>I just wanted to protect this one flower</i>

02:41.670 --> 02:44.380
<i>Wishing to be strong, I</i>

02:44.380 --> 02:47.040
<i>picked up the vulnerability 
I had once cast away</i>

02:47.040 --> 02:48.990
<i>Can't break free from the ambivalence</i>

02:48.990 --> 02:52.180
<i>In ambivalence, I become myself</i>

02:52.180 --> 02:54.890
<i>Like rooting strongly into the soil</i>

02:54.890 --> 02:57.440
<i>like swaying ephemerally to the wind</i>

02:57.440 --> 03:00.670
<i>I'm slowly loosening myself to bloom</i>

03:00.530 --> 03:03.660
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

03:07.580 --> 03:12.500
<b>Master and Student</b>

03:16.930 --> 03:19.770
<i>He's exhausted their tao 
by continuously striking</i>

03:19.770 --> 03:21.560
<i>the moment they start to regenerate.</i>

03:21.860 --> 03:25.540
<i>The wounds aren't fatal, but 
their regeneration has slowed a lot,</i>

03:25.540 --> 03:27.770
<i>and their appearance seems to be aging.</i>

03:28.190 --> 03:31.190
<i>They shouldn't be able to do much now.</i>

03:40.070 --> 03:44.250
Inanimate objects can be controlled 
with the slightest amount of tao.

03:44.980 --> 03:46.830
Die, human!

04:00.580 --> 04:03.220
<i>I'll take this opportunity to recover.</i>

04:03.570 --> 04:06.180
<i>He's exhausted as well.</i>

04:06.600 --> 04:11.270
<i>The repeated tao attacks 
are shortening his own life.</i>

04:15.480 --> 04:16.490
Sensei!

04:19.490 --> 04:21.990
A childish trick. This is pointless.

04:23.200 --> 04:25.970
<i>Tameshi Itto-ryu: Autumn Rains.</i>

04:37.100 --> 04:39.130
<i>He can't reach my tanden.</i>

04:40.420 --> 04:41.390
Clink?

04:55.150 --> 04:58.740
You're on the brink of death, too.

04:59.530 --> 05:01.530
What's wrong with you?

05:03.680 --> 05:04.530
Stay away!

05:10.700 --> 05:11.710
Sen—

05:29.010 --> 05:31.320
What's wrong with you?

05:31.320 --> 05:36.440
You'd shorten your own life 
for someone who died?

05:36.910 --> 05:38.810
Why do all of this?

05:42.810 --> 05:44.950
I haven't done anything yet.

05:45.030 --> 05:50.090
I can't mourn him or feel sadness yet.

05:50.770 --> 05:55.310
I can't even be angry 
while you're still alive.

05:56.430 --> 05:59.230
I'll do it all once I've killed you.

05:59.230 --> 06:01.970
The despair and sadness 
can wait until after that.

06:02.530 --> 06:06.890
Now, how many more times 
do I have to cut you to kill you?

06:07.720 --> 06:10.990
<i>This is bad. Really, really bad.</i>

06:10.990 --> 06:12.480
<i>I have to do something.</i>

06:12.480 --> 06:14.120
<i>Somehow...</i>

06:27.900 --> 06:29.240
<i>Don't panic.</i>

06:29.680 --> 06:33.240
<i>Tao doesn't recover quickly.</i>

06:42.510 --> 06:45.210
Did you think you were close?

06:45.210 --> 06:47.510
Don't underestimate me, human.

06:48.140 --> 06:51.260
One of my kind was always 
both male and female,

06:51.260 --> 06:55.020
circulating their energies 
by themselves to train.

06:55.410 --> 06:57.140
I copied that.

06:58.080 --> 07:02.900
It's hard to maintain both sexes at once, 
but I have no choice now.

07:02.900 --> 07:04.210
Besides...

07:06.060 --> 07:09.160
I knew it. I thought that was the case.

07:09.650 --> 07:11.350
If I can change part of myself,

07:11.350 --> 07:13.750
I must be able to do the same 
with my transformation.

07:16.200 --> 07:21.990
Now, how many hundreds more 
times shall we continue?

07:28.050 --> 07:31.560
I swear I'll settle this.

07:31.560 --> 07:35.310
I'm used to your little stunts now.

07:52.080 --> 07:53.390
<i>Stunts.</i>

07:55.090 --> 07:56.540
<i>Call them what you want.</i>

07:56.540 --> 07:58.050
<i>This is who I am.</i>

08:06.120 --> 08:09.800
<i>I was scarred by my mother, 
a traveling entertainer.</i>

08:12.300 --> 08:16.060
<b>See the Blade Master's Son</b>

08:12.300 --> 08:16.060
<i>Our act was a blind child dodging 
customer's strikes with a wooden sword.</i>

08:16.060 --> 08:19.300
<i>"Behold the blade master's son 
who predicts attacks without seeing."</i>

08:19.800 --> 08:23.570
<i>Both my mother and I were 
desperate to survive.</i>

08:25.330 --> 08:28.950
<i>The scars were part of the act, 
but I was born blind.</i>

08:28.950 --> 08:35.410
<i>As one who'd perceived the world 
through waves of tao, it was a simple act.</i>

08:38.180 --> 08:40.030
<i>A high-ranking kengyo heard about me</i>

08:40.030 --> 08:42.470
<i>and welcomed me into 
the Todoza guild for the blind.</i>

08:42.470 --> 08:45.810
<i>Through them, I knocked 
on the Yamada clan's doors.</i>

08:45.810 --> 08:50.220
<i>For a couple of poor entertainers, 
it was a golden opportunity.</i>

08:54.720 --> 08:59.700
Your child's skill with a sword 
makes it hard to believe he's blind.

08:59.700 --> 09:01.490
Where did he get those scars?

09:02.120 --> 09:05.080
This boy's father is famed 
for his skill with a blade.

09:05.080 --> 09:09.270
Blessed with talent, he was 
wounded in battle at a young age.

09:09.640 --> 09:14.030
<i>Every time we were asked, 
my mother told the same lie.</i>

09:18.750 --> 09:21.750
<i>So did I.</i>

09:23.970 --> 09:29.030
<i>Unable to retract that explanation 
and ruin my mother's name,</i>

09:29.390 --> 09:33.430
<i>I spent my days as a Yamada 
student hiding my past.</i>

09:34.100 --> 09:35.630
<i>I was ashamed.</i>

09:36.510 --> 09:39.050
It's not like the past matters.

09:39.050 --> 09:42.570
What's important is, 
you know, the present.

09:43.520 --> 09:45.130
That's not what I meant.

09:45.130 --> 09:47.630
I warned you to act 
like a Yamada student.

09:47.630 --> 09:53.660
I am, and I wish you'd look at me, 
not my upbringing.

09:54.580 --> 09:56.980
Tenza-kun and Shugen-san 
are fighting again.

09:56.980 --> 09:58.910
It's amusing. Leave them be.

10:01.510 --> 10:06.170
<i>I envied Tenza's openness 
and fearlessness.</i>

10:06.520 --> 10:11.500
<i>As I saw others accept him 
for who he was, I felt potential.</i>

10:14.050 --> 10:18.850
You're incredible with a sword, sir.

10:18.850 --> 10:20.980
I look up to you.

10:22.810 --> 10:27.070
<i>No, I look up to you.</i>

10:34.870 --> 10:39.940
<i>I will kill you with my own hands, 
even if it costs me my life!</i>

10:50.130 --> 10:53.360
I can use my Kishikai form 
while recovering.

10:53.360 --> 10:55.330
You cannot win any—

10:55.330 --> 10:56.330
Silence.

10:57.090 --> 11:01.010
Both your appearance and 
flashy abilities are empty threats.

11:01.680 --> 11:06.480
You're just focusing what little power 
you have left on putting on an act.

11:06.480 --> 11:09.360
Soon, you'll have only 
as much tao as a human.

11:09.780 --> 11:12.330
Your terrible acting can't fool me.

11:13.160 --> 11:19.250
Neither of us can strike a killing blow, 
so we'll drag each other through the mud.

11:19.250 --> 11:21.870
An ugly and deadly battle of endurance.

11:22.610 --> 11:23.950
Are you ready?

11:28.000 --> 11:29.200
Sensei!

11:30.730 --> 11:31.740
Nurugai.

11:36.660 --> 11:40.860
Stay back. I'll handle the rest.

11:40.860 --> 11:41.860
What?

11:43.000 --> 11:45.780
It's about to get dangerous.

11:48.900 --> 11:50.110
Damn you!

11:59.610 --> 12:03.280
<i>With no ability to hinder them, 
I can only hope to exhaust them.</i>

12:03.280 --> 12:07.270
<i>So how can I expend 
my own tao efficiently?</i>

12:08.150 --> 12:10.670
You don't have to cut 
them hundreds of times.

12:10.670 --> 12:13.250
Wouldn't it be easier 
to skewer them with your sword?

12:13.690 --> 12:15.010
True.

12:15.350 --> 12:17.450
That should be physically possible.

12:17.450 --> 12:21.760
The Tensen's tanden seem to be 
ovules within their bodies.

12:22.190 --> 12:25.160
Skewering would be efficient 
for exhausting their tao

12:25.160 --> 12:26.770
through continuous regeneration.

12:30.910 --> 12:34.990
Sever their limbs, or perhaps...

12:36.170 --> 12:39.400
extract only the ovule and skewer it.

12:39.890 --> 12:43.910
Since we're familiar with the practice 
of Hiemontori, it should be easy.

12:44.300 --> 12:47.220
The question is whether 
you can keep them skewered.

12:47.220 --> 12:48.790
Oh, right.

12:48.790 --> 12:52.670
Just imagining it grosses me out. 
I could never.

13:02.800 --> 13:05.680
Regenerate. Vines grow.

13:05.680 --> 13:07.450
Pull sword out.

13:07.450 --> 13:10.190
Stop you even if you hold in place.

13:10.890 --> 13:12.400
Enter you.

13:12.940 --> 13:14.270
Sensei!

13:18.590 --> 13:20.710
<i>They're weaker than I imagined.</i>

13:21.240 --> 13:23.400
<i>Is it because I exhausted their tao?</i>

13:24.060 --> 13:28.040
I told you it'd be a battle of endurance.

13:28.330 --> 13:32.040
Who will exhaust themselves first, 
you or me?

13:32.340 --> 13:34.370
I'm here to settle the score.

13:35.790 --> 13:39.050
If we both die, then I win!

13:39.080 --> 13:43.050
<b>Hell's Paradise</b>

13:52.530 --> 13:58.070
<i>This pain is nothing compared 
to his final moments...</i>

13:58.390 --> 14:00.570
Sensei, stop!

14:00.570 --> 14:02.450
If you keep going, you'll die!

14:02.820 --> 14:03.950
Stay away!

14:05.510 --> 14:09.700
If I keep fighting, I can take 
the monster down with me.

14:09.700 --> 14:14.710
You should get out of here 
and find the others.

14:15.320 --> 14:18.370
I will remain here.

14:19.920 --> 14:22.720
That doesn't make sense.

14:23.370 --> 14:25.720
You're smart.

14:25.720 --> 14:28.220
You think things through.

14:28.220 --> 14:31.010
You know how to make the right choice.

14:31.730 --> 14:33.650
This isn't like you!

14:36.830 --> 14:41.860
In that moment, I instantly 
understood his scream.

14:43.460 --> 14:45.810
He knew we couldn't win 
and wanted some of us to survive.

14:45.810 --> 14:49.200
I understood his intentions 
and acted instantly.

14:50.370 --> 14:53.080
It was the right choice.

14:54.590 --> 14:58.630
Why did I have to make the right choice?

14:59.700 --> 15:02.910
Even if it was foolish, 
why couldn't I have gone to him?

15:04.750 --> 15:10.630
He must've spent his final moments 
drowning in regret and pain.

15:11.500 --> 15:15.570
And all I could do was run. 
I can't forgive myself.

15:17.970 --> 15:23.150
Even while losing someone I loved, 
I made the right choice.

15:23.830 --> 15:25.320
I can't forgive myself.

15:27.990 --> 15:33.540
These eyes can't even shed tears, 
so at the very least...

15:37.170 --> 15:38.400
Sensei!

15:39.690 --> 15:43.670
Let me handle this and go to the others.

15:43.970 --> 15:46.170
But... that's not...

15:46.170 --> 15:47.020
Hurry!

15:47.930 --> 15:48.930
Hurry!

16:00.570 --> 16:04.030
<i>He's like I was back then.</i>

16:05.310 --> 16:10.560
<i>I lost the people I loved 
and couldn't forgive myself.</i>

16:16.490 --> 16:21.860
<i>He doesn't know if he 
should live or die, like me.</i>

16:22.790 --> 16:28.300
I'm the sole survivor. 
Everyone else died because of me.

16:34.060 --> 16:36.310
I don't get it.

16:38.810 --> 16:41.410
I'm asking if you want to die.

16:43.350 --> 16:46.570
Yeah, that's right.

16:46.990 --> 16:49.280
Until you explain it to me...

16:50.230 --> 16:56.080
Until I understand it, I... I'm not...

17:06.340 --> 17:09.090
Ten... Tenza...

17:09.370 --> 17:16.660
I, um... um, Sensei is... I...

17:21.800 --> 17:25.190
Then there's only one thing to do.

17:29.440 --> 17:30.700
Yeah.

17:42.630 --> 17:45.140
Until you explain it to me...

17:45.140 --> 17:49.410
Until I understand it, I'm not leaving.

17:52.800 --> 17:55.740
<i>I can't hear anything anymore.</i>

17:56.740 --> 18:01.230
<i>I don't know how much time has passed 
or how much more I can take.</i>

18:02.690 --> 18:09.180
<i>The only thing I can feel is my life 
slowly and clearly being eaten away.</i>

18:16.530 --> 18:22.760
<i>Slowly means skewering them 
was effective.</i>

18:24.220 --> 18:27.010
<i>Tenza, finally...</i>

18:36.290 --> 18:37.290
Nuru...

18:53.420 --> 18:54.700
What are you doing?

18:54.700 --> 18:57.230
Holding you so your tao will recover.

18:58.790 --> 19:01.190
This isn't the time.

19:03.090 --> 19:06.680
Girls should be more cautious 
about who they hold.

19:06.680 --> 19:08.590
You shouldn't be doing that 
for all kinds of reasons.

19:11.150 --> 19:14.340
Now you're starting 
to sound like yourself.

19:16.150 --> 19:17.310
Look.

19:18.350 --> 19:21.980
They're not dead, 
but their regeneration has slowed.

19:21.980 --> 19:24.850
It'll take a day for them to recover.

19:25.660 --> 19:28.100
So we should kill them now.

19:28.100 --> 19:31.350
No, so we should leave it be.

19:32.360 --> 19:34.980
They'll stab you with vines 
if you get close again.

19:34.980 --> 19:37.240
If you keep going, you'll die.

19:37.970 --> 19:40.870
Let's go join the others.

19:44.700 --> 19:46.940
I can't do that.

19:47.850 --> 19:51.380
Tenza won't be avenged 
until they stop breathing.

19:52.250 --> 19:54.420
His suffering...

19:55.630 --> 19:56.850
You're wrong.

19:58.310 --> 20:01.390
He didn't suffer or die with regrets.

20:02.070 --> 20:03.540
I'm wrong?

20:04.240 --> 20:08.790
When you carried me away, I saw him.

20:09.400 --> 20:12.650
He smiled.

20:13.250 --> 20:15.650
He saw us running away and smiled.

20:16.740 --> 20:20.510
You've been suffering 
because you didn't know that.

20:21.170 --> 20:23.980
It's because you had to 
carry me. I'm sorry.

20:25.010 --> 20:26.760
It was a nice smile.

20:27.570 --> 20:31.420
Sad but cool.

20:32.900 --> 20:36.940
So you don't have to avenge him, Sensei.

20:44.090 --> 20:50.690
We haven't talked much about Tenza 
because we've been focused on revenge.

20:51.740 --> 20:56.190
Tell me. I want to know more about him.

20:57.270 --> 21:02.580
We should talk more 
once we leave this place alive.

21:25.060 --> 21:26.470
You're right.

21:26.870 --> 21:31.420
Let's end this. 
I won't take this too far.

21:33.270 --> 21:35.010
Let's join the others.

21:37.790 --> 21:38.950
Yeah.

21:39.990 --> 21:42.350
Thank you, Nurugai.

21:42.900 --> 21:45.990
You've given me life.

21:54.010 --> 21:57.010
I should be calling you sensei.

21:57.650 --> 21:59.260
You opened my eyes.

22:00.430 --> 22:01.900
You can't hear me, can you?

22:10.140 --> 22:13.150
They got Zhu Jin.

22:13.770 --> 22:16.770
<b>Shion</b>

22:13.770 --> 22:16.770
<b>Nurugai</b>

22:17.600 --> 22:19.100
Shion-dono...

22:19.530 --> 22:21.530
<b>Shion</b>

22:23.330 --> 22:25.620
Won't you reconsider?

22:26.060 --> 22:30.060
We'll both just keep 
losing people we care about.

22:30.410 --> 22:33.380
It's too sad to continue.

22:35.580 --> 22:36.780
Please.

22:44.050 --> 22:46.550
<b>Yuzuriha</b>

22:44.050 --> 22:46.550
<b>Gabimaru</b>

22:46.550 --> 22:49.560
<b>Gabimaru</b>

22:50.560 --> 22:55.060
<b>Gabimaru</b>

23:08.100 --> 23:14.230
<i>On the other side, even today</i>

23:14.230 --> 23:20.190
<i>Someone is unraveling, 
yet they still stand</i>

23:20.190 --> 23:26.100
<i>A stab to the chest, this loneliness</i>

23:26.100 --> 23:31.930
<i>Points and lines, 
breaking off and vanishing</i>

23:31.930 --> 23:34.830
<i>My shattered mask</i>

23:34.830 --> 23:37.910
<i>It's more than I can bear</i>

23:37.910 --> 23:40.900
<i>But I must keep on living</i>

23:40.900 --> 23:45.690
<i>Tomorrow awaits to greet me</i>

23:45.690 --> 23:48.650
<i>It's endless</i>

23:48.650 --> 23:51.220
<i>And so fragile</i>

23:51.220 --> 23:57.450
<i>Is it better to believe 
hearts don't exist at all?</i>

23:57.450 --> 24:03.010
<i>Radiant and soft</i>

24:03.010 --> 24:04.720
<i>Was the hand</i>

24:04.720 --> 24:13.300
<i>I squeezed back on that day</i>
